    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d775">

                <pb facs="0933" n="921" sameAs="frus:frus1943v03/pg921"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.546/181: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Switzerland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Harrison</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bern</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-08-31T17:00:00+01:00">August 31, 1943—5
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 6:14 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>5381. Department’s 2112, August 30. Legation has continually been in direct
                    contact through officer Swiss Foreign Office with Japanese <pb facs="0934"
                        n="922" xml:id="pg922"/> Legation, Bern. This official expresses belief
                    request Spanish Ambassador due to unreasonable delays transmission messages
                    between Washington [and] Tokyo through Spain as Japanese protecting power and
                    consequent desire expedite such communications.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Harrison</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
